<h2>Tamanna AI</h2>
<p>This section documents Tamanna AI: its purpose, components, and how it integrates with bd-king-r7 Powerhub.</p>

<section>
    <h3>Purpose</h3>
    <p>Tamanna AI assists with automated code syncing, auto-fixing, build orchestration, and reporting. It acts as the supervisory layer that can reason about fixes and coordinate agents.</p>

    <h3>Components</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Agent: runs on servers to sync code, run linters & tests, and report results.</li>
        <li>Orchestrator: central server that stores reports and shows history.</li>
        <li>Auto-fix pipelines: rules & fixers tailored to project languages.</li>
    </ul>
</section>